ection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gWSZeCKrOfU\">https://youtu.be/gWSZeCKrOfU</a>\n</p><p>~MK\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l1RY_C20Q2M\">https://youtu.be/l1RY_C20Q2M</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HXHBTOGdMqo\">https://youtu.be/HXHBTOGdMqo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\